<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 107,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 107,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's actual</p>
<p>receipts 107,000 head. Opening trade was not well established.</p>
<p>Early sales of barrows and gilts steady with mid-session</p>
<p>Thursday. Top $48.00 per cwt.</p>
